ining Mode, Data Encryption Standard (DES) Algorithm – Overview of the DES Algorithm, Double and Triple DES – Double DES, Triple DES, Security of the DES. Include the relevant conditions, components, operating variables or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Cryptography and Network Security task and describe the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check against the stated objective and mention a limitation, error source or safety/design trade-off.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** Integer Factorization Problems appears in “Public Key Encryption”. Define its role and features, relate it to Characteristics of Public Key System, RSA Technique – Encryption-Method, Key Exchange, Diffie-Hellman Scheme, provide a practical example and state one process/design check or limitation. Confirm the details against official teaching material.\n\n**Principles/procedure (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and relate it to Characteristics of Public Key System, RSA Technique – Encryption-Method, Key Exchange, Diffie-Hellman Scheme, ElGamal. Include the relevant conditions, components, operating variables or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Cryptography and Network Security task and describe the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check against the stated objective and mention a limitation, error source or safety/design trade-off.\n\nMarking guide: meaning 2; principles/steps 3; application 2; verification 1. Confirm against official teaching material before use."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

